dict</surname><given-names>FG</given-names></name></person-group><source>A study of prolonged fasting</source><year>1915</year><publisher-name>Publication no. 203. Carnegie Institute, Washington</publisher-name></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ginde</surname><given-names>SR</given-names></name><name><surname>Geliebter</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Rubiano</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Silva</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Heshka</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Heymsfield</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Air displacement plethysmography: validation in overweight and obese subjects</article-title><source>Obes Res</source><year>2005</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>1232</fpage><lpage>7</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16076993</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/oby.2005.146</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Heymsfield</surname><given-names>SB</given-names></name><name><surname>Gallagher</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Kotler</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>Z</given-names></name><name><surname>Allison</surname><given-names>DB</given-names></name><name><surname>Heshka</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Body-size dependence of resting energy expenditure can be attributed to non-energetic homogeneity of fat-free mass</article-title><source>Am J Physiol Endocrinol Metab</source><year>2002</year><volume>282</volume><fpage>E132</fpage><lpage>8</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11739093</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal